# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# <body>
#
# <footer>
#
# Conventional Commits Format:
# type: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, chore, ci, revert
# scope: (optional) component or module affected
# subject: (required) brief description of change
# body: (optional) detailed explanation of what and why
# footer: (optional) references to issues or breaking changes
#
# Examples:
# feat(auth): Add TOTP-based 2FA support
# fix(api): Resolve rate limit calculation error
# docs: Update architecture documentation
# refactor(server): Improve error handling middleware
# perf(cache): Implement TTL-based caching
#
# Dispatch Pro - Lead Agent SaaS Platform
